    "spec": "When the computed customerCode collides with an existing owner's customerCode, append '-<n>' with the smallest n of 2 or more that makes it unique; return the de-duplicated 'customerCode'.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nWhen the computed customerCode collides with an existing owner's customerCode, append '-<n>' with the smallest n of 2 or more that makes it unique; return the de-duplicated 'customerCode'.\n"
